{"title":"1950 AHSME Problems/Problem 17","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1950_AHSME_Problems/Problem_17&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The formula which expresses the relationship between <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/2/092e364e1d9d19ad5fffb0b46ef4cc7f2da02c1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" /> as shown in the accompanying table is:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/e/d/4ed7c1eaa2515e47df2f96e491ca3fb4eba26556.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\begin{tabular}[t]{|c|c|c|c|c|c|}\\hline x&amp;0&amp;1&amp;2&amp;3&amp;4\\\\\\hline y&amp;100&amp;90&amp;70&amp;40&amp;0\\\\\\hline\\end{tabular}\\]\" width=\"212\" height=\"42\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/5/e/35e82a75d3b102374c5397eb650f733865e3e155.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ y=100-10x\\qquad\\textbf{(B)}\\ y=100-5x^{2}\\qquad\\textbf{(C)}\\ y=100-5x-5x^{2}\\qquad\\\\ \\textbf{(D)}\\ y=20-x-x^{2}\\qquad\\textbf{(E)}\\ \\text{None of these}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"542\" height=\"39\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1950_AHSME_Problems/Problem_17&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Plug in the points <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/8/b/e8b5410b1945687d3a9e6e7253d11630246c958b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(0,100)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"56\" height=\"18\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/8/6/b86f58cb609fa753024f1173510c877971f8e4e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(4,0)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"38\" height=\"18\" /> into each equation. The only one that works for both points is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/3/8/838a5316c92b52342dce3e4c981a7689a70a9556.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\mathrm{(C)}.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"31\" height=\"18\" /> Plug in the rest of the points to confirm the answer is indeed <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/4/d/d4d9f7e41e363eb82a49d9c2f7b3b59978a70acd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\mathrm{(C)}\\ y=100-5x-5x^2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"196\" height=\"31\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1950_AHSME_Problems/Problem_17&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1950_AHSME\" title=\"1950 AHSME\">1950 AHSC</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1950_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1950 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1950_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1950 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1950\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b>